# ---- Datasets (never commit) ----
# The image data is several GB and comes from public sources; see the README
# for download links and the folder layout the scripts expect.
# data/nih_3class/ is generated by src/build_dataset_v2.py - reproducible, so
# there is no reason to commit the images. The manifest is small enough to keep
# as a record of exactly which images landed in which split.
data/
!data/nih_3class/manifest.csv

# ---- Models ----
# The final model (~12 MB) is committed so the app runs after cloning.
# Intermediate checkpoints from the ablation are not - they are reproducible
# from the scripts. The metrics JSON files ARE committed: they are tiny and
# they are the evidence behind every number quoted in the README.
models/*
!models/binary_6880.keras
!models/*_metrics.json

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---- Editor / OS ----
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.save

# ---- Outputs ----
*.log
outputs/
